---
import '../styles/global.css';
const services = [
 ['Console repairs','Power problems. Overheating. A screen that stays black.','PlayStation / Xbox / Nintendo Switch'],
 ['Controller repairs','Stick drift, unresponsive buttons and charging issues.','DualSense / DualShock / Joy-Con / Xbox'],
 ['Ports & connections','Damaged HDMI ports and loose charging connections.','HDMI / USB / Charging'],
 ['Cleaning & maintenance','Dust buildup, loud fans and tired thermal paste.','Cleaning / Thermal servicing'],
 ['Handheld & retro','Keep the consoles you grew up with in the game.','PSP / PS Vita / DS / Game Boy'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>JTLB Repair Clinic — Get back in the game.</title><meta name="description" content="J The Last Boss Repair Clinic. Console, controller and handheld repair. Explore repair services and prepare your repair enquiry."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#141613"/><link rel="icon" href="/images/jtlb-icon.jpg"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="JTLB home"><img src="/images/jtlb-icon.jpg" width="48" height="48" alt=""/><span>JTLB<span class="brand-sub">REPAIR CLINIC</span></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#services">What we fix</a><a href="#process">How it works</a><a href="#faq">Questions</a></nav><a class="button small" href="#repair">Start a repair <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>GAME OVER?<br/><span>NOT YET.</span></h1><p>Your console has another life in it.<br/>Let’s get you back to playing.</p><a class="button" href="#repair">Tell us what’s broken <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#services">Explore repair services ↓</a><div class="hero-foot">CONSOLES. CONTROLLERS. SECOND CHANCES.</div></div><figure class="hero-art"><img src="/images/jtlb-logo.jpg" alt="JTLB Repair Clinic's zombie technician mascot repairing a circuit board" width="900" height="900" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>THE REPAIR BENCH BEHIND J THE LAST BOSS.</figcaption></figure></section>
<div class="platforms" aria-label="Devices serviced"><span>PlayStation</span><span>Xbox</span><span>Nintendo Switch</span><span>Handheld & retro</span></div>
<section id="services" class="services section"><div class="section-intro"><h2>Good gear.<br/>Worth saving.</h2><p>A broken port shouldn’t end a good run. Find your device below, then tell us what happened.</p></div><div class="service-list">{services.map(([name,description,devices])=><a href="#repair" class="service"><div><h3>{name}</h3><p>{description}</p><span>{devices}</span></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section id="process" class="process section"><h2>Less guessing.<br/>More gaming.</h2><div class="steps"><article><span>01 / THE PROBLEM</span><h3>Tell the story.</h3><p>Which device? What’s wrong? What happened before it stopped working? A little detail goes a long way.</p></article><article><span>02 / THE PLAN</span><h3>Know the next step.</h3><p>Ask about diagnosis, parts, cost and turnaround before agreeing to a repair.</p></article><article><span>03 / THE COMEBACK</span><h3>Back to your save.</h3><p>Confirm collection arrangements and ask about testing, care and warranty coverage for your repair.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="faq" class="faq section"><h2>Before you<br/>bring it in.</h2><div><details><summary>How much will my repair cost?</summary><p>The device, fault and parts determine the cost. Include your model and symptoms in your enquiry so the shop can advise you.</p></details><details><summary>What should I include in my enquiry?</summary><p>Your exact device model, the fault, when it started and any previous repairs. Mention liquid damage or drops too.</p></details><details><summary>How long will it take?</summary><p>Timing depends on diagnosis and parts availability. Ask the shop for an estimate for your specific device.</p></details><details><summary>Should I bring cables and accessories?</summary><p>Ask what’s needed to reproduce the issue before dropping off your device. Back up your saves where possible.</p></details></div></section>
<section id="repair" class="repair section"><div><h2>Let’s talk<br/><span>repairs.</span></h2><p>Prepare the details of your repair below. Copy your enquiry and send it through your usual JTLB contact channel.</p><p class="note">Direct booking details are being verified. This form prepares a message; it does not submit a booking.</p></div><form id="repair-form"><label>Device<select name="device" required><option value="">Choose your device</option><option>PlayStation 5</option><option>PlayStation 4</option><option>Xbox</option><option>Nintendo Switch</option><option>Controller</option><option>Handheld / retro</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>What’s going wrong?<textarea name="issue" rows="4" required minlength="10" placeholder="Device model, symptoms and when the problem started…"></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Copy repair enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><textarea id="copy-fallback" aria-label="Your prepared enquiry" hidden readonly></textarea></form></section></main>
<footer><a class="brand" href="#"><img src="/images/jtlb-icon.jpg" width="44" height="44" alt=""/><span>J THE LAST BOSS<span class="brand-sub">REPAIR CLINIC</span></span></a><p>Loot. Repair. Repeat.</p><a href="#main">Back to top ↑</a></footer>
<script>
const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#repair-form');
form?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {event.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(form);const message=`Hi JTLB! I'd like to enquire about a repair.\nDevice: ${data.get('device')}\nIssue: ${data.get('issue')}`;const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#form-status')!;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(message);status.textContent='Enquiry copied. Paste it into your conversation with JTLB.';}catch{const fallback=document.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('#copy-fallback')!;fallback.hidden=false;fallback.value=message;fallback.select();status.textContent='Your enquiry is ready below. Select and copy it to send to JTLB.';}});
</script></body></html>
